/* 验证手机号之后授权头像和昵称的弹层（底部弹出）。z-index 要压过页面里的遮罩和支付确认。 */
.pa-mask {
  position: fixed;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  top: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  z-index: 10000;
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-end;
}
.pa-sheet {
  width: 100%;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  background: #fff;
  border-radius: 28rpx 28rpx 0 0;
  padding: 40rpx 40rpx calc(40rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
}
.pa-form {
  width: 100%;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
}
.pa-title {
  font-size: 36rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #181818;
}
.pa-sub {
  margin-top: 12rpx;
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: #888;
  text-align: center;
}
/* app.wxss 给所有 button 设了 groove 灰边框、背景色和 40px 高度，这里的按钮要自己把它们盖掉 */
.pa-avatar-btn {
  margin: 32rpx 0 0;
  padding: 0;
  width: 160rpx;
  height: 160rpx;
  line-height: 1;
  border: none;
  border-style: none;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: transparent;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.pa-avatar-btn::after {
  border: none;
}
.pa-avatar {
  width: 160rpx;
  height: 160rpx;
  border-radius: 50%;
}
.pa-avatar-empty {
  background: #ededed;
  color: #999;
  font-size: 28rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}
.pa-avatar-tip {
  margin-top: 14rpx;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: #07c160;
}
.pa-field {
  margin-top: 32rpx;
  width: 100%;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 0 8rpx;
  height: 96rpx;
  border-top: 1rpx solid #eee;
  border-bottom: 1rpx solid #eee;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
.pa-label {
  width: 110rpx;
  font-size: 30rpx;
  color: #181818;
}
.pa-input {
  flex: 1;
  height: 96rpx;
  font-size: 30rpx;
  text-align: left;
}
.pa-error {
  margin-top: 20rpx;
  width: 100%;
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: #fa5151;
  text-align: center;
}
.pa-actions {
  margin-top: 40rpx;
  width: 100%;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
}
.pa-btn {
  width: 48%;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  height: 88rpx;
  line-height: 88rpx;
  font-size: 32rpx;
  border: none;
  border-style: none;
  border-radius: 12rpx;
}
.pa-btn::after {
  border: none;
}
.pa-btn-skip {
  background: #f2f2f2;
  color: #555;
}
.pa-btn-save {
  background: #07c160;
  color: #fff;
}
.pa-btn-save[disabled] {
  background: #9ce0bb;
  color: #fff;
}
